flowchart TD
    A[Cancel request] --> B{Reservation exists and actor authorized?}
    B -- No --> X[Reject]
    B -- Yes --> C{Already CANCELLED?}
    C -- Yes --> I[Return CANCELLED]
    C -- No --> D{CONFIRMED or PENDING_APPROVAL?}
    D -- No --> X
    D -- Yes --> E{currentTime < startTime?}
    E -- No --> X
    E -- Yes --> F[Set CANCELLED]
    F --> I
